Hi everyone,

Asking for some help this time. I’m looking for market suggestions for both LMSR and CLOB on PREDYX.

* For LMSR, feel free to suggest markets on any topic. We'll put in good liquidity there. 

* For CLOB, we’re looking for upcoming matches from popular sports over the next 30 days or so — NFL, NBA, EPL, Champions League, or any other major leagues.

We’ll use these markets to **test the CLOB infrastructure, and gather feedback**.

Would appreciate any suggestions!


Thanks.  

@Coinsreporter @grayruby @BlokchainB @Undisciplined @OT @Wumbo @south_korea_ln @SimpleStacker @ACYK @softglitter2d @ken @DarkStacker @itsTomekK @needcreations_
@Solomonsatoshi @afpsniper88
@kepford @Cje95 @Jer @denlillaapan @gsc360

@benthecarman has been helping the Coinbase people get lightning integrated into their [x402 standard](https://www.coinbase.com/developer-platform/discover/launches/x402) and it looks like it was finally merged yesterday. 

I haven't been tracking x402 very much -- seems like there are at least ten different groups pushing a 402 standard, but it is cool to see lightning being added to as many as possible.

There are a number of helpful posts about x402 in the related post section below.

